ening even without a clean sleep-quality signal yet tying the two together.", "Selenium today is 0mcg vs the ~55mcg target (tracked daily, not weekly, since it can overshoot in one sitting) — 2-3 Brazil nuts, fish, or eggs would close the gap without real risk of going over.", "Folate averaging 211 vs a ~400 target over the last 2 day(s) (53%) — tracked weekly, not daily (a slow-reserve nutrient) — add leafy greens, legumes on a lighter day to bring the average up.", "Average logged sleep is 7.2h across 105 nights tracked — an established trend at this point, not a sample. 58/105 nights (55%) landed in the 7-9h target band.", "9 ejaculation event(s) logged in the last 14 days — aiming for roughly every 1-2 days (8-14 over a 14-day span) tracks best with the sperm-quality research.", "Weight is -0.75 kg vs. the 2026-06-27 baseline, 2.7 kg from the 76-78 kg target range — pace is steady but slower than the 0.4 kg/week goal; tightening portions on non-restaurant days would help most."]}